From {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|διαστολή||separation, drawing asunder|lang=grc}}, from {{term|διά||apart|tr=diá|lang=grc|sc=polytonic}} + {{term|στέλλειν||send|lang=grc|sc=polytonic}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{physiology}} The [[relaxation]] and [[dilation]] of the [[heart]] chambers, between contractions, during which they fill with blood.

